  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Tokummia katalepsis. Fossil compression does not preserve exact living depth. Shell thickness, body padding, color, joint angles and pose are interpretations. Head homologies and phylogenetic placement remain researched questions; follow the cited museum interpretation without claiming certainty. Reduced or absent eyes are unresolved: omit prominent eyes, not claim proven blindness. Exact dimensions and limb counts below are modeling conventions, not specimen measurements.",
    "zh": "Tokummia katalepsis 的示意性活体复原。壳厚、体厚、颜色、关节角度和姿态为解释，头部同源性及亲缘位置仍有研究空间；不突出眼睛并不等于证实失明，尺寸及肢数约定不视为标本实测。"
  },
